  "summary": "Over 20 years of software engineering experience with proficiency in full product development lifecycle, strategic planning, IP geolocation, and Enterprise Resource Planning (ERP), and Portfolio Accounting System (PAS). Adept at analyzing requirements and developing state-of-the-art solutions to strengthen reliability and productivity.  Considerable strengths and success in business analysis and development, process improvements, customer relationship management, and team leadership. Extensive experience in software design and development, database management, and solution implementation with Waterfall and/or Agile paradigm. Excel in developing, designing and enhancing software; leverage unparalleled vision to plan, organize and produce innovative products, features and integrations. Exceptional communication skills – fluent in English and Korean.\n\n•\tSuccessfully led analysis, design, and development of Portfolio Accounting System (PAS) to meet government regulations for Employee Stock Plans.\n•\tChampioned development of NetGeo’s first revenue generating product, ngLog, a comprehensive real-time, web log analysis application for e-Commerce sites.\n•\tProductively designed and implemented core technology of mapping IPs to geological locations.\n•\tLeveraged outstanding technical acumen to create and implement client/server application for InfoScope Enterprise and APIs for InfoScope Standard (IP geolocation products).\n•\tSuccessfully planned, engineered, and implemented state-of-the-art ERP (enterprise resource planning) systems for numerous clients in various industries.\n•\tLed design, development and launch of online ID Theft Protection system (TIP) for Verifia.\n•\tResourcefully built robots and parsers to fully automate data collection process.\n•\tAdeptly managed terabyte-size database efforts including replication, backup, schema designs, stored procedures, optimizations, and triggers.\n•\tQuickly adapt to new roles, responsibilities, technologies and environments.\n\nSpecialties: Database Technologies: ERWin, Visio, MySQL, MS SQL, Oracle\nProgramming Languages:  Perl, Java, C++, MS Visual Basic, PowerBuilder\nOperating Systems: Windows, Unix \nTools & Applications: Visual Source Safe, SVN, CVS, Eclipse, Crystal Report, Oracle Forms, Report Writer",
